{"id":"3d8db0438534f9d8","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FUsesRow.md","title":"FUsesRow","display":"FUsesRow","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"FUsesRow","parameters":["E","F","R","f","r","z2281","z2282","z2283"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"FUsesRow"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>E</span><span>F</span><span>R</span><span>f</span><span>r</span><span>z2281</span><span>z2282</span><span>z2283</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：对象理论公理代码。有序参数：<code>E</code>、<code>F</code>、<code>R</code>、<code>f</code>、<code>r</code>、<code>z2281</code>、<code>z2282</code>、<code>z2283</code>。</p>\n<p>一阶公式中的所有变量名字，包括量词声明；用于保守的新鲜性选择。：单行局部条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ FUsesRow E F R f r z2281 z2282 z2283)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists x\n  (exists t\n    (and\n      (@ Pair x t z2283)\n      (and\n        (@ Nat x)\n        (and\n          (@ FFm E F R f r t)\n          (or\n            (exists z2286\n              (exists z2287\n                (exists z2288\n                  (exists z2289\n                    (exists z2290\n                      (and\n                        (@ FRel z2286 z2287 t)\n                        (and (@ Seq z2287 z2288) (and (in z2289 z2288) (and (@ App z2287 z2289 z2290) (@ FTFree F f x z2290))))))))))\n            (or\n              (exists z2291\n                (exists z2292 (and (@ FEq z2291 z2292 t) (or (@ FTFree F f x z2291) (@ FTFree F f x z2292)))))\n              (or\n                (exists z2291\n                  (and\n                    (@ PNeg z2291 t)\n                    (exists z2294\n                      (exists z2295 (and (in z2294 z2282) (and (@ App z2281 z2294 z2295) (@ Pair x z2291 z2295)))))))\n                (or\n                  (exists z2291\n                    (exists z2292\n                      (and\n                        (@ PImp z2291 z2292 t)\n                        (or\n                          (exists z2296\n                            (exists z2297 (and (in z2296 z2282) (and (@ App z2281 z2296 z2297) (@ Pair x z2291 z2297)))))\n                          (exists z2298\n                            (exists z2299 (and (in z2298 z2282) (and (@ App z2281 z2298 z2299) (@ Pair x z2292 z2299)))))))))\n                  (exists z2293\n                    (exists z2291\n                      (and\n                        (@ FAll z2293 z2291 t)\n                        (or\n                          (= z2293 x)\n                          (exists z2300\n                            (exists z2301 (and (in z2300 z2282) (and (@ App z2281 z2300 z2301) (@ Pair x z2291 z2301))))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b01633bdf3140514\" href=\"?note=b01633bdf3140514\" title=\"ZFC_FAll\">FAll</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f6a39a2c0a4c17e7\" href=\"?note=f6a39a2c0a4c17e7\" title=\"ZFC_FEq\">FEq</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7d109a270c3f3d46\" href=\"?note=7d109a270c3f3d46\" title=\"ZFC_FFm\">FFm</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"372f265dbb09b97a\" href=\"?note=372f265dbb09b97a\" title=\"ZFC_FRel\">FRel</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d2980fe49e8b1fcc\" href=\"?note=d2980fe49e8b1fcc\" title=\"ZFC_FTFree\">FTFree</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"